ttings- VS BOTS: Choose the number of bots on the screen that opens after VS BOTS- Shop price tags are now dark with cream text and easier to read- The room code box is wider, so the hint text fits- Fixed Chinese or Japanese letters staying on screen after switching to another language- Shortened texts that didn't fit thei","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-18T17:14:07Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706687530","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:02:23Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5046250-1846651706687190","game_id":"steam-5046250","kind":"update","title":"0.2.1 - Patch Notes","summary":"- VS BOTS: Bots now adapt to the clock - when time runs short they hurry and still answer, but rushing makes them misspell more- VS BOTS: Sabotage coupons now work on bots - every audio or typing sabotage you play on a bot lowers its chance of getting the word right- VS BOTS: Stop Sign now works on bots too - they have to wait it out before typing- VS BOTS: Longer words take bots longer to type- VS BOTS: Every bot now has its own personality for the whole match - some type fast but sloppy, other","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-18T15:07:05Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706687190","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:02:23Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5046250-1846651706685983","game_id":"steam-5046250","kind":"update","title":"0.2.0 - Demo Patch Notes","summary":"- Added a Tutorial (top of the Play menu) - ClackO walks you through your first match- Reworked Avatar Studio: Pencil/Eraser/Fill/Picker/Line tools, undo/redo, mirror drawing, Surprise button, in-game preview- VS BOTS: Shop and coupon phase are no longer timed - press PASS when you're ready- PASS buttons now pulse- Playing a coupon is clearer: valid targets pulse and show a USE button, plus a hint line- Added ACTIVE x/3 and PASSIVE x/2 slot counters- Passive coupons now have a gold name box- Sho","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-18T02:26:24Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706685983","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:02:23Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-5046250":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T07:37:08Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T07:37:07Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-5046250":"2026-10-26T07:37:08Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"5046250":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T07:37:07Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T07:37:07Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T07:37:07Z"},"5103470":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T07:37:08Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T07:37:08Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T07:37:08Z"}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-5046250","app_id":5046250,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:15:19Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw_item_sha256":"b527615e3ee3bbd94a4c89cda41ff6970e68df1aec552a82b590aaa6907d2e65","response_sha256":null,"source_fields":{"basic_info":{"short_description":"단어를 듣는다. 12초 안에 입력한다. 틀리면 12명 플레이어 순위표에서 떨어져 제거될 때까지 계속 내려간다. 단어 사이에 쿠폰을 구매하여 상대의 오디오를 왜곡하고, 입력을 섞고, 그들의 달러를 훔친다.","publishers":[{"name":"Porto Palma Studios"}],"developers":[{"name":"Porto Palma Studios"}]},"release":{"steam_release_date":1793732400,"is_coming_soon":true,"coming_soon_display":"date_full"},"trailers":{"highlights":[{"trailer_name":"Main Trailer","trailer_url_